    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Three days until the baby arrives. Three days to save the world.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205260/extras/ac781de12cc0dc865b83b896f124c335.poster.avif?t=1753965116\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205260/extras/ac781de12cc0dc865b83b896f124c335.webm?t=1753965116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205260/extras/ac781de12cc0dc865b83b896f124c335.mp4?t=1753965116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Welcome to the House</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new baby is coming in three days! There\u2019s so much to do, especially if Barty Bear is to prevent the Colic from returning once again. Luckily, with the help of the Bubble Fairy, Barty has all the time he needs. Explore the House to recover the lost puppies who hold the key to stopping this calamity. Or choose to go in a completely different direction, discovering several alternate plans to save the day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At any point during the three-day cycle, you can choose to loop back in time to the morning of the first day. But before you restart, the Bubble Fairy will let you keep some things with you. Powerups, relationship statuses, quest progress... you have the freedom to choose exactly how to start the new cycle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205260/extras/189c7cf01c3a315ca76cb05b2ff19893.avif?t=1753965116\" width=616 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205260/extras/b5420ab926c1aeef40da9c12d4d30dc0.poster.avif?t=1753965116\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205260/extras/b5420ab926c1aeef40da9c12d4d30dc0.webm?t=1753965116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205260/extras/b5420ab926c1aeef40da9c12d4d30dc0.mp4?t=1753965116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> each and every room in the House. From the quaint Stuffie's Town to the tropical Bathtub Resort, from the spacious Kitchen to dusty Underbed, there's always secrets, stories, and surprises to discover. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle</strong> through hoards of hostile dust bunnies, rotten food, and not-age-appropriate toys, including over 40 boss battles! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harness</strong> the abilities of nearly a dozen, kid-tested, parent-approved powerups. A blankie, floaties, a bottle, and more, Barty will need them all in order to save the day! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Collect</strong> a whole bunch of other helpful items as well, such as storybook pages, puzzle pieces, and letter blocks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Play </strong>in six unique minigames, including the House's most-watched sport, The Playpen!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205260/extras/4d63d082e475f657231c50826710c016.avif?t=1753965116\" width=616 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205260/extras/8b605b20030c7484c7d093c7538168e0.poster.avif?t=1753965116\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205260/extras/8b605b20030c7484c7d093c7538168e0.webm?t=1753965116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205260/extras/8b605b20030c7484c7d093c7538168e0.mp4?t=1753965116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet</strong> and get to know over 300 NPCs, each with their own personality, likes, and dislikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintain</strong> Barty's relationship with every single toy in the game, and choose whether to save that relationship in the time loop or reset it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205260/extras/94023d22bb0894efee94a178d2642cbc.poster.avif?t=1753965116\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205260/extras/94023d22bb0894efee94a178d2642cbc.webm?t=1753965116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romance</strong> any of the twelve Old Toys, gaining their trust and providing them with comfort throughout the trying three days. Be careful though! A negative relationship with any of them could turn them into your nemesis, and Barty will soon find himself in the middle of a boss fight if he doesn't mind his manners!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> and <strong>decorate</strong> the Old Toys' Bin (their headquarters and home) using dozens of different themes and items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205260/extras/706dbc1e040694a7bdffc1758ccfa82e.avif?t=1753965116\" width=616 height=170 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master</strong> the time loop by choosing exactly when Barty returns to the morning of his first day in the House.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Execute</strong> strategic decisions as to who or what is not reset with the change in time. This includes NPCs memories and relationships, quest progress, enemies and bosses defeated, or collectables and powerups discovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>End</strong> the three day cycle on your own terms, whenever you think Barty has done enough to prepare for the oncoming Colic. Your preparations and discoveries will dictate what the future holds for the toys in the House.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Three days until the baby arrives. Three days to save the world.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205260/extras/ac781de12cc0dc865b83b896f124c335.poster.avif?t=1753965116\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205260/extras/ac781de12cc0dc865b83b896f124c335.webm?t=1753965116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205260/extras/ac781de12cc0dc865b83b896f124c335.mp4?t=1753965116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Welcome to the House</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new baby is coming in three days! There\u2019s so much to do, especially if Barty Bear is to prevent the Colic from returning once again. Luckily, with the help of the Bubble Fairy, Barty has all the time he needs. Explore the House to recover the lost puppies who hold the key to stopping this calamity. Or choose to go in a completely different direction, discovering several alternate plans to save the day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At any point during the three-day cycle, you can choose to loop back in time to the morning of the first day. But before you restart, the Bubble Fairy will let you keep some things with you. Powerups, relationship statuses, quest progress... you have the freedom to choose exactly how to start the new cycle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205260/extras/189c7cf01c3a315ca76cb05b2ff19893.avif?t=1753965116\" width=616 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\