</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205260/extras/706dbc1e040694a7bdffc1758ccfa82e.avif?t=1753965116\" width=616 height=170 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master</strong> the time loop by choosing exactly when Barty returns to the morning of his first day in the House.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Execute</strong> strategic decisions as to who or what is not reset with the change in time. This includes NPCs memories and relationships, quest progress, enemies and bosses defeated, or collectables and powerups discovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>End</strong> the three day cycle on your own terms, whenever you think Barty has done enough to prepare for the oncoming Colic. Your preparations and discoveries will dictate what the future holds for the toys in the House.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Discover the world of Barty\u2019s Adventure: a cozy, time-loop metroidvania set in the world of children\u2019s toys. Make new friends, explore unique biomes, and master the three-day cycle to stop the Colic from returning once and for all!",
    "supported_languages": "English",
